{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50993","headline":"句 · 刘吉","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一箭不中鹄，五湖归钓鱼。\n（《赠隐者》。\n见《宋诗纪事》卷三引《历代吟谱》。\n按《全唐诗》卷七百九十五作张茔诗句。\n云见地志。\n）（《增修诗话总龟》卷一引《丛苑》、《宋朝事实类苑》卷五五引《杨文公谈苑》幷载刘吉此二句诗，并云其「有诗三百首，目爲《钓鳌集》，徐铉爲序。\n其首篇《赠隐者》，……人多诵之」。\n《全唐诗》所收张茔，应张莹，《淳熙三山志》卷二、卷三四收此二句爲其诗。\n二句似验刘作爲近是。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}